**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/*.pem
**/*.pfx
**/*.key
# Dependencies, build output and machine state
**/node_modules/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/dist/
**/.angular/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/Thumbs.db
KsSquare-Backend/.product-cleanup/
KsSquare-Backend/CustomerOrdersRepair/
